    {%- comment -%} NF-PERF-0911: heading_font (Roboto Serif) preload removed. Headings render in Poynter Oldstyle (--heading-font-family is overridden), so this ~220KB file was fetched at top priority on every page and never used. Its @font-face stays, so anything that does use it still loads it on demand. {%- endcomment -%}

